endorsed by, or made by Sabotage Studio.

The MIT license below covers the original source code in this repository
(player.py and the project documentation). It does not cover, and does not
grant any right to:

- Sea of Stars, its characters, names, story, music, or trademarks. Those
  belong to their owners, including Sabotage Studio.
- The soundtrack. No audio files are included here. Buy Sea of Stars - OST
  on Steam if you want the music this player reads:
  https://store.steampowered.com/app/2550490/Sea_of_Stars__OST/
- The pictures in skin/. Those are unofficial fan paintings made so the
  window has a face. They are not official game assets, and they are not
  offered under the MIT license.

